<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>ORE - Diamond Sea and Treasure Sea - 130,000 tonnes Dampier/Beilun 1-15/11 $3.40 fio scale load/30,000 shex.</p>
<p>Cosmotrust - 110,000 tonnes ore Dampier/Beilun 1-15/11 $3.70 fio scale load/15,000 shex CSG.</p>
<p>There were no fixtures reported from New York on Tuesday.</p>
